{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["And the sense of לא אעשה בעבור הארבעים: 'I will not do' the destruction, and that the second omission not be extended afterward — if the fourth is subtracted, also the third, also the half. And some say: why did He not diminish below ten, because there are two in every city, for there were five cities. This is not correct, because He spoke of Sodom alone. And though our Sages of blessed memory transmitted that public prayer is not less than ten, this verse too will strengthen the hands of our faith."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:45:01.924335200Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}